y the issue, and return it to its owner if necessary."], ["you put two fingers on the machine housing. you wait. the vibration comes, then goes. you turn the wheel once. you look at the floor. it is still there. you look at the machine. it is still there.", "you look at the vibration, then at the machine. “it is not a vibration. it is a noise.” you turn the wheel. “the wheel is not moving. the wheel is. the wheel is not moving.” you look at the floor. “the floor is not moving. the floor is. the floor is not.” you turn the wheel again. “the vibration is not a vibration. it is a noise.” you look at the machine. “the machine is not moving. it is not moving.” you look at the floor. “the floor is not moving. the floor is.” you turn the wheel again. “the floor is not moving. the floor is.”"], ["you put two fingers on the machine housing. you wait. the vibration comes, then goes. you turn the wheel once. you look at the floor. it is still there. you look at the machine. it is still there.", "you monitor the machine, record when the vibration occurs, and inspect likely causes."], ["you bring the six objects close. seed tin. tin with a hole in the lid. tin with a hole in the lid. you put the first in the crevice. you put the second in the corner. you hold the third. the others wait.", "you bring them close to your face. the first one is a seed tin. you put it in the crevice. the second is a seed tin with a hole in the lid. you put it in the corner. the third is a seed tin with a hole in the lid. you put it in the corner. the fourth is a seed tin with a hole in the lid. you put it in the corner. the fifth is a seed tin with a hole in the lid. you put it in the corner. the sixth is a seed tin with a hole in the lid. you put it in the corner."], ["you bring the six objects close. seed tin. tin with a hole in the lid. tin with a hole in the lid. you put the first in the crevice. you put the second in the corner. you hold the third. the others wait.", "you sort the objects into s