in is still falling. you wait for the rain to stop. then you look at the empty seam. you can mark it with a stick. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the seed. you mark it with the"], ["you put the cup down and press the seam with your claw. the rain is still falling. you mark the seam with a seed. then you move the seed one inch away. you wait for the rain to stop.", "you relax with a cup of tea and enjoy the quiet moment."], ["you look at the small thing, then at the stranger. you put it in your palm. “it is mine. it is not mine. i will show you where it is kept.” you wait. “where?”", "you look at the small thing, then at the stranger. “small.” you put it in the palm of your hand. “i know it is small. i know it is not mine. but it is mine. i will show you where it is kept.” you wait for the stranger to look at you, then ask: “where?”"], ["you look at the small thing, then at the stranger. you put it in your palm. “it is mine. it is not mine. i will show you where it is kept.” you wait. “where?”", "you agree to lend the item, note when it is due back, and hand it over."], ["you look at the interruption, then at the task. you wait for the interruption to pass. it does not. you pick up the tool. “easier?” you turn the task around. you wait for the interruption to be over.", "you look at the interruption, then at the task. you can do nothing. you can wait for the interruption to pass. you can wait for the interruption to pass. you can wait for the interruption to be over. you can wait for the interruption to be over. you can wait for the interruption to be over."], ["you look at the inter